{{!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     nav-icon — one icon per navigation item, chosen from its slug.
     ------------------------------------------------------------------------
     Ghost's navigation carries only a label and a URL, so there is nowhere
     for the site owner to attach an icon. Mapping from the slug is the
     alternative: it needs no extra setting, and it means renaming a menu item
     in Admin keeps its icon as long as the word survives.

     `slug` is slugify(label), so "-Data Cloud" arrives as "data-cloud" — the
     leading marker is already gone and children match the same way parents do.

     TO ADD ONE: a case below, and the icon in partials/icons/. The fallback
     is deliberately neutral rather than a guess — a wrong icon reads as a
     mistake, a generic one reads as "no icon yet".
     ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ --}}
{{~#match slug "home"}}{{> "icons/home"}}
{{~else match slug "courses"}}{{> "icons/books"}}
{{~else match slug "course"}}{{> "icons/books"}}
{{~else match slug "training"}}{{> "icons/graduation-cap"}}
{{~else match slug "learn"}}{{> "icons/graduation-cap"}}
{{~else match slug "roadmap"}}{{> "icons/strategy"}}
{{~else match slug "roadmaps"}}{{> "icons/strategy"}}
{{~else match slug "blog"}}{{> "icons/article"}}
{{~else match slug "writing"}}{{> "icons/article"}}
{{~else match slug "docs"}}{{> "icons/book-open-text"}}
{{~else match slug "documentation"}}{{> "icons/book-open-text"}}
{{~else match slug "resources"}}{{> "icons/compass"}}
{{~else match slug "toolkit"}}{{> "icons/flask"}}
{{~else match slug "labs"}}{{> "icons/flask"}}
{{~else match slug "pricing"}}{{> "icons/tag"}}
{{~else match slug "newsletter"}}{{> "icons/envelope"}}
{{~else match slug "community"}}{{> "icons/users-three"}}
{{~else match slug "about"}}{{> "icons/user-circle"}}
{{~else match slug "contact"}}{{> "icons/envelope"}}
{{~else match slug "code"}}{{> "icons/code"}}
{{~else match slug "snippets"}}{{> "icons/code"}}
{{~else match slug "youtube"}}{{> "icons/brand-youtube"}}
{{~else match slug "github"}}{{> "icons/brand-github"}}
{{~else match slug "linkedin"}}{{> "icons/brand-linkedin"}}
{{~else}}{{> "icons/link"}}
{{~/match}}
